FLOW1
# f01: the full VS path -> g01 params (fox / marth / battlefield,
# default settings; pre-registration AGENT-LOG iter 88).
# startup runs frames 1-370 (timer transition), then: title -> START ->
# menu-top -> A on VS. MELEE -> menu-battle -> A on LOCAL VS -> css ->
# two RIGHTs on the P1 row (marth -> puff -> fox) -> START -> sss ->
# A on battlefield (cursor default 0) -> LAUNCH.
I 1 -
SHOT 200 startup
SHOT 373 title
I 375 S
I 376 -
SHOT 378 menu-top
I 380 A
I 381 -
SHOT 383 menu-battle
I 385 A
I 386 -
I 390 R
I 391 -
I 395 R
I 396 -
SHOT 400 css
I 405 S
I 406 -
SHOT 410 sss
I 415 A
I 416 -
END 420
